{"2551250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexforger", "steam_appid": 2551250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/e055bf144c7840a3f795f3422fbc86fb.avif?t=1786378644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras_big/e055bf144c7840a3f795f3422fbc86fb.webp?t=1786378644 width=1560 height=440 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft devastating magic from the three primordial orbs. With 10 spell combinations per run, you forge your arsenal on the fly. Scale your spells to infinity, tear through the horde in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of up to four and turn the battlefield into a slaughterfest. Synergize your spells and crush the horde together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerups and burst open chests as the horde grows out of control. Ring the bell to push the run five minutes further, empowering the forces of darkness and raising the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 spells to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+100 challenges to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 realms to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 bosses to vanquish</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/59612a5c51a605853a191b85172c8110.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft devastating magic from the three primordial orbs. With 10 spell combinations per run, you forge your arsenal on the fly. Scale your spells to infinity, tear through the horde in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08a41859e6fc1df6923a0882f6f44cf3.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of up to four and turn the battlefield into a slaughterfest. Synergize your spells and crush the horde together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/2677bbcc3e8cacd6fb760298b99e8ab6.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerups and burst open chests as the horde grows out of control. Ring the bell to push the run five minutes further, empowering the forces of darkness and raising the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.poster.avif?t=1786378644\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.webm?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/08abd7998abb7b7f2b7552bb8d821dc4.mp4?t=1786378644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 spells to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+100 challenges to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 realms to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 bosses to vanquish</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Craft your spells in ONLINE CO-OP with your friends in this SURVIVORS-LIKE! Slaughter monsters, gain gold, upgrade your spells to infinite heights. Crush challenges and unlock new spells, upgrades, pickups, realms. Up to 4 players in this unique twist on the survivors-like formula!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/d86aec013bca429d11142c2e83d0cf908e755f54/header.jpg?t=1786378644", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/ceb5f88eafa5b57db3ac53d3772778c52d598d87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786378644", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/ceb5f88eafa5b57db3ac53d3772778c52d598d87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786378644", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7300HQ or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Dedicated GPU required, OpenGL 4.6 support required</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["PELERIN SOFTWARE"], "publishers": ["PELERIN SOFTWARE"], "demos": [{"appid": 4008110, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"},